MODULE: SettledUndoUnfencedFenceKept
TARGET: SettledUndoUnfenced
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: undo returns with the original physical shards still fenced
PERTURBS: UndoClear

--- FIND
    /\ fenced' = {} /\ mirror' = FALSE /\ undoable' = FALSE
--- REPLACE
    /\ fenced' = fenced /\ mirror' = FALSE /\ undoable' = FALSE
--- END
